        "Description": "My lucky towel #42 was stolen Agent 42, by an ungrateful DJ, and we got a bagel impersonator dancing on the floor. Do your lord and saviour Bob, wielder of spaghetti thunderstorms and use explosive mustard ducks ONLY to remove these heretics.\r\rOnce you are done, you may make contracts yourself, and Bob will play them for their amusement.\r\rDo not disappoint me agent 42.\r\rWear your best suit, or clown suit for this!",
